<http://data.silknow.org/object/3d3f939c-318f-36c7-b379-60ecc9ba9a21>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel of brocaded green gauze, woven with a ribbed effect and watered. \n\nThe design is brocaded in flat gold paper strip, orange, purple, blue, green and white silks. A spray of flowers, each composed of chrysanthemum and dahlias, is placed in each lower corner, and a wicker basket containing grasses and flowers resembling lilies occupies the centre of the space above. \n\nThe ground weft threads are grouped alternatively 1 and 3. The brocaded weft threads are grouped in fours.\n\nThe panel may have been the cover of a window. It is joined horizontally down the centre, the edges there both being selvedges. The outer sides are cut."@en , "Panel of brocaded gauze, Japan, 18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/cf16e670-1532-3249-b78a-0eba43d840f0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c5484120-f222-3966-87a5-288c9578246c> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel of brocaded green gauze, woven with a ribbed effect and watered. \n\nThe design is brocaded in flat gold paper strip, orange, purple, blue, green and white silks. A spray of flowers, each composed of chrysanthemum and dahlias, is placed in each lower corner, and a wicker basket containing grasses and flowers resembling lilies occupies the centre of the space above. \n\nThe ground weft threads are grouped alternatively 1 and 3. The brocaded weft threads are grouped in fours.\n\nThe panel may have been the cover of a window. It is joined horizontally down the centre, the edges there both being selvedges. The outer sides are cut."@en , "Panel of brocaded gauze, Japan, 18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/3d3f939c-318f-36c7-b379-60ecc9ba9a21/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/3d3f939c-318f-36c7-b379-60ecc9ba9a21/dimension/1> ;
